-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Etowah County has come in under 90% of normal in September to October 37 times in 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, November to December ran 41% of normal while May to June ran 177%. Grid 16978 had its driest year in 2007 at 51% of normal, and its preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 76.3.</p>"}
